        decision_rationale:
          '✅ **`interpreted_rules` stored successfully** (2 rows, ordered by `order_of_execution`). Here is the full interpretation:\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Business Rules Interpretation — `Bunker_Reclass`\n\n### 🗂️ Document Metadata\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Document Name** | `Bunker_Reclass` |\n| **Sub-System** | Journal Entry (`sub_system_id: 007`) |\n| **Owner** | Hawama A |\n| **Approved By** | Galmak.Hanna |\n| **Version** | 1.5 |\n| **Process** | Non-Judgemental JV Preparation: Bunker Reclass to Materials |\n| **Timing** | Monthly, Day-4 |\n| **System** | SAP |\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Rules Summary — 2 Active Rules Found\n\n| # | Rule ID | Title | Type | Order | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `Bunker_Reclass - R001` | Extract Fuel Items Production Cost Centers | **Sourcing** | 1 | ✅ Enabled |\n| 2 | `Bunker_Reclass - R002` | Reclass Line Items to Target GL and Cost Center | **Calculation** | 2 | ✅ Enabled |\n\n> ⚠️ **No Validation rule (Order=2 type)** is defined for this document. The workflow moves directly from Sourcing → Calculation.\n\n---\n\n### 🔎 Rule Deep-Dive\n\n---\n\n#### 📥 Rule 1 — `Bunker_Reclass - R001` | **SOURCING** | Order: 1\n\n> *"Extract GL listing for Fuel items from SAP using T-Code KSB1"*\n\n| Attribute | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| **Action** | SAP T-Code **KSB1** extraction (GL listing for Fuel items) |\n| **Output Dataset** | `KSB1 Report` — GL listing for Fuel items under Production Cost Centers |\n| **Source Table** | ⚠️ **No explicit `table(...)` reference** — data is sourced directly from **SAP via T-Code KSB1** (manual/automated extraction). Default fallback `r2a.journal.je_preparation` does **not** apply here; SAP is the upstream system. |\n\n**Filter Conditions Applied During Extraction:**\n\n| Field | Operator | Value |\n|---|---|---|\n| `controlling_area` | `=` | `PH01` |\n| `cost_center` | `BETWEEN` | `2500000 AND 2599999` (Production Cost Centers) |\n| `cost_element` | `>=` | `41702024` |\n| `posting_date` | `BETWEEN` | `01.01.2025 AND 31.12.2025` |\n| `company_code` | `=` | `4707` |\n\n**Controls:** None defined at sourcing stage.\n\n---\n\n#### 🔁 Rule 2 — `Bunker_Reclass - R002` | **CALCULATION** | Order: 2\n\n> *"Reclassify gl_account on KSB1 Report — reclass all line items to GL 41804001 and CC 2540104"*\n\n| Attribute | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| **Action Type** | `reclassify` |\n| **Input** | Output of R001 (`KSB1 Report`) |\n| **Target GL Account** | `41804001` |\n| **Target Cost Center** | `2540104` |\n| **Output Dataset** | `Reclassified journal entries` — all line items reclassed to GL `41804001` / CC `2540104` |\n\n**Formula:**\n```\nFOR EACH line_item IN KSB1_Report:\n    SET gl_account   = 41804001\n    SET cost_center  = 2540104\n```\n\n**Controls:**\n- ✅ *"Make sure that control totals match with the journal entries `company_code`"* — a post-calculation reconciliation check is required.\n\n---\n\n### 🗄️ Source Tables Referenced\n\n| Rule | Source Reference | Type | Table / System |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| R001 | SAP T-Code `KSB1` | External SAP System | No UC table — SAP extraction |\n| R002 ',
